cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata.
title: "spice-kernel-db: browse, get, and manage SPICE kernels across NASA and ESA mission archives"
abstract: >-
  A content-addressed database and command-line tool for SPICE kernels and
  metakernels. It indexes local kernel trees by SHA-256, resolves metakernels
  against the NAIF and ESA archives, verifies local copies against the server,
  and finds duplicates across mission directories.
type: software
